---
description: Monopo Saigon visual system for all Resonant UI
globs: src/**/*.{tsx,css}
---

When building UI for this project, first run:
  designmdme --website <domain>

Then reference DESIGN-monopo-saigon.md, src/app/theme.css,
src/app/variables.css, and src/app/tokens.json.

Hard rules from that spec:
- Interface is black / white / gray only. Iridescence is hero media, never a control.
- No distinct CTA color. Ghost pills: 75px radius, 11×33 padding, 1px border.
- Cards, images, inputs: 0px radius. Buttons and tags: 75px. Never 1–74px.
- No drop shadows. Flat surfaces and hairline 1px borders.
- Roobert → Inter (300 / 400 / 600). Raleway → Montserrat, headings only.
- Display 225px weight 400. Whisper section titles 78px weight 300.
- Motion: cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1), 0.8–1.25s.
- Brand stays Resonant. No skip / next control.
- Homepage still names Listen Now, Favorite Songs, Connect Apple Music.
